# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# F1Pulse — Web (apps/web)
# Copy to .env.local for local dev. The web app talks ONLY to F1Pulse's own API.
# It must NEVER hold third-party API URLs or keys — those live in apps/server.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL of F1Pulse's own API (apps/server). Public — safe to expose to browser.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
